/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fmingcute_medium-fill.124b7920.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/mingcute_medium-fill.png"></a><a class="m-auto" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/selfie-live-llc/"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mr-2 mt-2 img-20" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fri_linkedin-fill.58e321b6.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fri_linkedin-fill.58e321b6.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/ri_linkedin-fill.png"></a><a class="m-auto" target="_blank" href="https://www.facebook.com/selfiedotlive"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mr-2 mt-2 img-20" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fri_facebook-fill.acbbcdf8.png&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fri_facebook-fill.acbbcdf8.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/ri_facebook-fill.png"></a><a class="m-auto" target="_blank" href="https://www.youtube.com/@selfiedotlive"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 576 512" class="mr-2 mt-2.5 img-20 text-black" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M549.655 124.083c-6.281-23.65-24.787-42.276-48.284-48.597C458.781 64 288 64 288 64S117.22 64 74.629 75.486c-23.497 6.322-42.003 24.947-48.284 48.597-11.412 42.867-11.412 132.305-11.412 132.305s0 89.438 11.412 132.305c6.281 23.65 24.787 41.5 48.284 47.821C117.22 448 288 448 288 448s170.78 0 213.371-11.486c23.497-6.321 42.003-24.171 48.284-47.821 11.412-42.867 11.412-132.305 11.412-132.305s0-89.438-11.412-132.305zm-317.51 213.508V175.185l142.739 81.205-142.739 81.201z"></path></svg></a></div><div class="flex float-right"><a target="_blank" class="text-base font-semibold border-2 rounded-xl border-black py-1 px-2 text-black mr-2" href="https://www.selfierewards.live/sign-up">Sign up</a><a target="_blank" class="text-base font-semibold border-2 rounded-xl border-black py-1 px-2 text-black ml-2" href="https://www.selfierewards.live/sign-in">Sign in</a></div></div><div class="flex lg:hidden"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md p-2.5 main-font-color"><span class="sr-only">Open main menu</span><svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6.75h16.5M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25h16.5"></path></svg></button></div></nav></header><div><section class="h-2/6 bg-black w-full overflow-hidden"><div class="lg:block md:block hidden px-4 lg:px-28 md:px-10 py-7 "><div class="flex justify-between"><a href="https://www.selfie.live/"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="229" height="51" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mr-2 h-11 w-52" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Flogo_self.d0069276.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Flogo_self.d0069276.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/logo_self.png"></a><a target="_blank" class="flex items-center text-white" href="https://www.selfierewards.live/">Selfie Rewards<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square-arrow-out-up-right ml-2"><path d="M21 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path><path d="m21 3-9 9"></path><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="lg:block md:block hidden relative"><div class="absolute"><div class="text-white lg:px-28 md:px-10 pt-7 text-6xl  font-rb main-bold"><p>Take a <span class="main-font-color">selfie</span></p><p>Get an autograph </p><p>Earn rewards</p></div><div class="text-white lg:px-28 md:px-10 pb-7 pt-2">Where Fans and Celebrities connect to<br> create a lifetime of memories.</div></div><img alt="Selfie" loading="lazy" width="2160" height="1026" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mr-2 pt-4" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhero_selfies.74ded1d0.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 1x" src="./Selfie_files/hero_selfies.png"></div><div class="lg:hidden md:hidden"><div class="absolute"><div class="text-white lg:px-28 md:px-10 pt-7 pl-2 text-6xl font-rb main-small"><p>Take a <span class="main-font-color">selfie</span></p><p>Get an autograph </p><p>Earn rewards</p></div><div class="text-main-yellow bg-blur rounded-lg p-1 mt-2 lg:px-28 md:px-10 pt-2">Where Fans and Celebrities connect to<br> create a lifetime of memories.</div></div><img alt="Selfie" loading="lazy" width="2160" height="1026" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mr-2 pt-16" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fhero_selfies.74ded1d0.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 1x" src="./Selfie_files/hero_selfies.png"></div></section><section class="h-2/6 slate-background w-full"><div class="px-4 lg:px-28 md:px-10 py-7 flex flex-col lg:flex-row md:flex-row"><div class="lg:basis-1/2 md:basis-1/2 basis-full pt-16"><div class=" main-font-color text-5xl font-rb font-semibold">Selfie.live: where fans meet their stars</div><div><p class="pt-8 text-white">Everybody has a favorite star, whether it's a musician, athlete, actor, comedian, or political powerhouse.&nbsp;We love&nbsp;to attend their games, concerts, and events.</p><p class="pt-4 text-white">You take selfies and our stars make them into incredible memories. Post to social media, save to your personal album, or trade them through an NFT Exchange. Whatever you do, the experience is yours for a lifetime.</p></div></div><div class="lg:basis-1/2 md:basis-1/2 basis-full  pt-16 flex items-center justify-center" style="height:inherit"><div><div><div class="text-white">App For Fans</div><div class="flex"><a target="_blank" href="https://apps.apple.com/ua/app/selfie-live-fan-app/id1622043497"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="274" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mr-2 pt-4 h-14 w-32" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FDownload_from_app_store.e0f4b805.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FDownload_from_app_store.e0f4b805.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/Download_from_app_store.png"></a><a target="_blank" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.selfie_live&amp;pli=1"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="274" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mr-2 pt-4 h-14 w-32" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FDownload_from_play_store.a9892243.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FDownload_from_play_store.a9892243.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/Download_from_play_store.png"></a></div></div><div class="pt-7"><div class="text-white">App For Celebrities and Ambassadors</div><div class="flex"><a target="_blank" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/selfie-live-celebrity-app/id1634196083"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="274" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mr-2 pt-4 h-14 w-32" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FDownload_from_app_store.e0f4b805.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FDownload_from_app_store.e0f4b805.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/Download_from_app_store.png"></a><a target="_blank" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.youniquecelebrity"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="274" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mr-2 pt-4 h-14 w-32" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FDownload_from_play_store.a9892243.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FDownload_from_play_store.a9892243.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/Download_from_play_store.png"></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="h-2/6 bg-black w-full"><div class="pt-20 px-4 lg:px-28 md:px-10 py-7"><div class="text-5xl main-font-color font-rb text-center ">SFREWARD TOKENS – Loyalty and Referral Program</div><div class="px-2 py-10 lg:px-8 md:px-8 "><div class="text-white text-lg">At Selfie.Live, we are built for Web3. Our tokenized rewards program will have many aspects including:<ul class="list-disc mb-4"><li class="ml-8">Earning SFREWARDs tokens for downloading and using the mobile apps.</li><li class="ml-8"> Referring new users.</li><li class="ml-8"> Social media posts.</li><li class="ml-8">Subscribing to other products like domain names and NFT storage.</li></ul></div><div class="pt-3 flex text-lg main-font-color">Go to our<!-- --> <a target="_blank" class="flex items-center ml-2 underline" href="https://www.selfierewards.live/">Rewards Program<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square-arrow-out-up-right mx-2"><path d="M21 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path><path d="m21 3-9 9"></path><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path></svg></a>page for more information and start earning now.</div></div></div></section><section class="h-2/6 bg-black w-full"><div class="lg:px-28 md:px-10 px-4 py-7"><div class="text-5xl main-font-color font-rb md:text-center lg:text-center  ">Celebrity. Fans. Nothing in between</div><div class="text-white pt-16"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="bg-main-yellow h-52"><div class="text-center mt-16"><div class="text-xl font-bold text-black">The Selfie.Live Mission</div><div class="lg:px-20 px-10 py-2 text-black">For Yourself, For Your Family, For Your Friends</div></div></div><div class="h-52"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="500" height="344" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FGifting-min.02f70058.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FGifting-min.02f70058.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/Gifting-min.jpeg"></div><div class="bg-main-yellow h-52"><div class="text-center mt-16"><div class="text-xl font-bold text-black">Charities</div><div class="lg:px-20 px-10 py-2 text-black">Give and You Shall Receive</div></div></div><div class="h-52"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="500" height="344" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fmission-min.c0766cf3.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fmission-min.c0766cf3.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/mission-min.jpeg"></div><div class="bg-main-yellow h-52"><div class="text-center mt-16"><div class="text-xl font-bold text-black">Gifting</div><div class="lg:px-20 px-10 py-2 text-black">Personalize An Experience that Matters</div></div></div><div class="h-52"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="500" height="344" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FCharities-min.a691fe72.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FCharities-min.a691fe72.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/Charities-min.jpeg"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="h-2/6 bg-black w-full"><div class="lg:px-28 md:px-10 px-4 py-16"><div class="text-5xl main-font-color font-rb text-center  ">The Art of Selfie Expression</div><div class="flex lg:flex-row md:flex-row flex-col"><div class="w-full mx-2"><div class="lg:w-full h-80 md:w-full w-3/4 m-auto mt-16 h-10 bg-main-yellow flex flex-col relative"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="464" height="704" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-72 w-52 m-auto mt-8" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FClick_photo.14545d2f.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FClick_photo.14545d2f.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/Click_photo.png"><div class="absolute left-0 bg-white bottom-6 px-2 py-1.5 font-bold">Click Photo</div></div><div class="text-center text-white px-8 py-6">Take a photo of you at a live event or doing something you would want signed by the celebrity.</div></div><div class="w-full mx-2"><div class="lg:w-full md:w-full w-3/4 m-auto h-80 mt-16 h-10 bg-main-yellow flex flex-col relative"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="464" height="704" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-72 w-52 m-auto mt-8" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FSubmit_photo.c4a1bb30.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FSubmit_photo.c4a1bb30.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/Submit_photo.png"><div class="absolute left-0 bg-white bottom-6 px-2 py-1.5 font-bold">Submit Photo</div></div><div class="text-center text-white px-8 py-6">Submit the photo to your favorite celebrity for a chance to win a personalized NFT photo</div></div><div class="w-full mx-2"><div class="lg:w-full md:w-full w-3/4 m-auto h-80 mt-16 h-10 bg-main-yellow flex flex-col relative"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="464" height="704" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-72 w-52 m-auto mt-8" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fget_nft.4f07eb72.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fget_nft.4f07eb72.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/get_nft.png"><div class="absolute left-0 bg-white bottom-6 px-2 py-1.5 font-bold">Get Nft</div></div><div class="text-center text-white px-8 py-6">Receive your Selfie.Live NFT!</div></div></div></div></section><section class="h-2/6 bg-black w-full"><div class="lg:px-28 md:px-10 px-4 py-7"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row md:flex-row"><div class="lg:basis-1/2 md:basis-1/2 basis-full "><div class="text-5xl main-font-color font-rb  ">Become an Ambassador and Multiply Your Rewards</div><div class="pt-8 text-white">Ambassadors are celebrities in their own&nbsp; right. You can be part of the signing elite by having your friends sign up and send you a selfie to sign. It adds up to big bonuses in rewards tokens that may be later turned into SFLIVE tokens.<!-- --> <div class="py-3 text-sm">Find out how to be an Ambassador by filling out the<!-- --> <a class="text-main-yellow underline" href="https://www.selfie.live/#contact-us-section"> <!-- -->Celebrity Connect form.</a></div></div></div><div class="lg:basis-1/2 md:basis-1/2 basis-full flex items-center justify-center "><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="1280" height="853" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mt-5 lg:mt-0 md:mt-0 h-72 w-96" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fambassador.d1291f50.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fambassador.d1291f50.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/ambassador.jpeg"></div></div></div></section><section class="h-2/6 slate-background w-full"><div class="pt-20 lg:px-28 md:px-10 px-4 py-7"><div class="text-5xl main-font-color font-rb text-center ">Celebrity</div><div class="text-white py-12 lg:px-28 md:px-10 px-4 text-center"><p>You didn’t become a celebrity without having a tight schedule and long hours. We understand this and want to&nbsp;make your life easy.&nbsp;Your fans want to engage with you and we are making it easy for them to get into crypto in a way that won’t make you look bad and will keep your image safe.</p><p class="pt-4">As a Celebrity, you can give signed selfies away to your fans for free or offer a paid version. Earn while you sign and make a fan's day!</p></div></div></section><section class="h-2/6 bg-black w-full"><div class="pt-20 lg:pl-28 md:pl-10 px-4 py-7"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row md:flex-row"><div class="lg:basis-1/2 md:basis-1/2 basis-full "><div class="text-5xl main-font-color font-rb">This is how a celebrity works with us</div><div class="lg:w-96 md:w-96 w-80 pt-16"><div class="main-font-color text-6xl float-left">01</div><div class="text-white h-40 ml-28"><div class="font-bold">Select Number</div><div class="pt-4">Pick the number of autographs you are comfortable with signing.</div></div></div><div class="lg:w-96 md:w-96 w-80"><div class="main-font-color text-6xl float-left">02</div><div class="text-white h-40 ml-28"><div class="font-bold">Choose Price</div><div class="pt-4">We give you a range. Contact us for custom pricing.</div></div></div><div class="lg:w-96 md:w-96 w-80"><div class="main-font-color text-6xl float-left">03</div><div class="text-white h-40 ml-28"><div class="font-bold">Receive Photos</div><div class="pt-4">Choose the price you want to charge to guarantee a signed selfie.</div></div></div><div class="lg:w-96 md:w-96 w-80"><div class="main-font-color text-6xl float-left">04</div><div class="text-white h-40 ml-28"><div class="font-bold">Sign &amp; Relax</div><div class="pt-4">From the comfort of your bus or jet you just sign your fans photos by using an iPad or Android Tablet with a digital pencil</div></div></div></div><div class="lg:basis-1/2 md:basis-1/2 basis-full"><div class="relative h-93"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="1022" height="1656" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="pt-1 l z-10 h-full w-5/6 relative m-auto" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fthis_is_how.02149687.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fthis_is_how.02149687.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/this_is_how.png"><div class="bottom-0 absolute bg-main-yellow w-full h-64"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="h-2/6 bg-black w-full"><div class="pt-20 lg:px-28 md:px-10 px-4 py-7"><div class="text-5xl main-font-color font-rb text-center ">Our Icons</div><div class="text-white py-4 lg:px-28 md:px-10 px-4 text-center">See a Selection of Our Stars and Selfies They Have Signed</div><div class="text-black py-4 lg:px-28 md:px-10 px-4 text-center"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 text-primary-foreground h-10 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-main-yellow bg-main-yellow rounded-md lg:w-80 md:w-80"><a target="_blank" href="https://opensea.io/collection/selfiedotlive">OpenSea Collection</a></button></div></div></section><section class="h-2/6 bg-black w-full"><div class="pt-20 px-4 py-7"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="2109" height="824" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Four_icons.cc8067be.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 1x" src="./Selfie_files/our_icons.jpeg"></div></section><section class="h-2/6 bg-black w-full"><div class="lg:px-28 md:px-10 px-4 pt-20 "><div class="border-4 rounded border-zinc-950 py-12"><div class="text-5xl main-font-color font-rb text-center  ">Fan Moment</div><div class="text-white p-4 text-center">Captured the euphoria, shared the thrill, a fan moment video</div><video class="m-auto rounded-xl" width="750" height="500" controls="" poster="new-poster-min.png"><source src="/video/lee_brice_promo_video.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div></div></section><section class="h-2/6 bg-black w-full"><div class="lg:px-28 md:px-10 px-4 pt-20  "><div class="text-5xl main-font-color font-rb text-center  ">Get in touch</div><div class="text-white p-3 text-center">Reach out, and let's create a universe of fans together!</div><div id="contact-us-section" class="m-auto rounded-xl slate-background"><div class="flex lg:flex-row md:flex-row flex-col"><div class="lg:basis-1/2 md:basis-1/2 basis-full"><div class="p-14"><div class="text-white text-3xl font-medium">Celebrities, let’s connect for your Fans</div><div class="text-white text-sm py-3 font-extralight">Contact us and we will show you how to drive fan engagement and make revenue that you can share with charities or capture for your own use</div><form id="contact-us"><div class="flex mt-8 "><div class="w-1/2 pr-1"><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 text-white" for="firstName">First Name</label><input type="First Name" class="flex h-10 rounded-md border border-input px-3 py-2 text-sm ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 text-slate-300 bg-gray-950 w-full mr-1.5" placeholder="First Name" value=""></div><div class="w-1/2 pl-1"><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 text-white" for="lastName">Last Name</label><input type="Last Name" class="flex h-10 rounded-md border border-input px-3 py-2 text-sm ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 text-slate-300 bg-gray-950 w-full" placeholder="Last Name" value=""></div></div><div class="mt-3"><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 text-white" for="email">Email</label><input type="Email" class="flex h-10 rounded-md border border-input px-3 py-2 text-sm ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 text-slate-300 bg-gray-950 w-full" placeholder="Email" value=""></div><div class="mt-3"><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 text-white" for="phoneNumber">Phone Number</label><input type="Phone Number" class="flex h-10 rounded-md border border-input px-3 py-2 text-sm ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 text-slate-300 bg-gray-950 w-full" placeholder="Phone Number" value=""></div><div class="mt-3"><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 text-white" for="message">Message</label><textarea class="flex min-h-[80px] rounded-md border border-input px-3 py-2 text-sm ring-offset-background placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 text-slate-300 bg-gray-950 w-full" placeholder="Message"></textarea></div><div class="mt-3"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 text-primary-foreground h-10 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-main-yellow bg-main-yellow rounded-md w-full" type="submit">Send it to Selfie.Live</button></div></form></div></div><div class="lg:basis-1/2 md:basis-1/2 basis-full"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="1032" height="1072" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="p-8 h-full w-full" style="color:transparent" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FLets_connect2.70bacb3f.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2FLets_connect2.70bacb3f.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x" src="./Selfie_files/Lets_connect2.png"></div></div></div></div></section></div><section class="h-2/6 bg-black w-full"><div id="subscription-form-section" class="lg:px-28 md:px-10 px-4 py-7 pt-20 pb-10"><div class="flex lg:flex-row md:flex-row flex-col"><div class="basis-1/2"><div><div class="text-white text-2xl font-rb-light   ">Join our mailing list and hear about new deals, celebrities and other news</div><div class="relative"><form class=" flex flex-col m-4" action="https://login.sendpulse.com/forms/simple/u/eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjo4MDExNzM3LCJhZGRyZXNzX2Jvb2tfaWQiOjYxMTA2MSwibGFuZyI6ImVuIn0=" method="post" target="_blank"><label class="text-white text-lg">First name</label><input class="text-slate-300 bg-gray-950 w-full rounded-lg p-2 mb-4 border border-slate-300" placeholder="Enter Name" type="text" name="name"><label class="text-white text-lg">Email</label><input class="text-slate-300 bg-gray-950 w-full rounded-lg p-2 mb-8 border border-slate-300" type="email" placeholder="Enter Email" required="" name="email"><input type="hidden" name="sender" value="Alex@selfie.live"><button class=" hover:bg-main-yellow bg-main-yellow rounded-md w-full p-2">Subscribe</button></form></div></div></div><div class="basis-1/2"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse lg:flex-row md:flex-row ml-0 lg:ml-20 md:ml-20 "><div class="lg:basis-1/2 md:basis-1/2 basis-full mt-10 md:mt-0 lg:mt-0"><div class="font-semibold text-white">Tokens</div><div class="text-sm mt-1 font-light text-slate-300"><a target="_blank" href="https://www.selfierewards.live/">SFLIVE</a></div><div class="text-sm mt-1 font-light text-slate-300"><a target="_blank" href="https://www.selfierewards.live/">SFREWARD</a></div></div><div class="lg:basis-1/2